Jesus Revolution is a drama, history film directed by Brent McCorkle.

3
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
In the 1970s, aimless teenager Greg Laurie searches for all the right things in all the wrong
places until he meets Lonnie Frisbee, a charismatic hippie/street preacher.

4
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:46,000
Together with local pastor Chuck Smith, they open the doors of
a languishing church to an unexpected revival.

